### =========================================================================
### Wealth Portal API — try every endpoint from VS Code.
### Needs the "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client).
### Click "Send Request" above any request. Start with the two sign-ins:
### the other requests reuse their tokens automatically.
###
### Prefer a browser? http://localhost:8090/swagger-ui.html
###   -> Authorize -> sign in as rm1 or client1 -> "Try it out" on any endpoint.
### =========================================================================

@api = http://localhost:8090
@keycloak = http://localhost:8180/realms/wealth/protocol/openid-connect/token

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- sign in
# @name rm
POST {{keycloak}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=wealth-api-tests&username=rm1&password=Manager%232026

###
# @name client
POST {{keycloak}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=wealth-api-tests&username=client1&password=Client%232026

###
@rmToken = {{rm.response.body.access_token}}
@clientToken = {{client.response.body.access_token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- basics
GET {{api}}/actuator/health

###
GET {{api}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}

###
POST {{api}}/api/session/start
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- RM book
GET {{api}}/api/rm/home
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/rm/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/rm/clients?q=dupont
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}

### Clara Dupont: details, portfolios, MiFID
GET {{api}}/api/clients/1
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}

### Noah Weber belongs to rm2 -> 404 for rm1
GET {{api}}/api/clients/8
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- portfolios
GET {{api}}/api/portfolios/1
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}

### Pieter's portfolio with options and a future
GET {{api}}/api/portfolios/7
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- instruments
GET {{api}}/api/instruments?q=asml
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/instruments?assetClass=OPTION
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- MiFID
GET {{api}}/api/mifid/questionnaire
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}

### Liam O'Connor (client 4) has no profile yet
GET {{api}}/api/clients/4/mifid
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}

### Start a review for Liam (returns the open one if it exists)
# @name review
POST {{api}}/api/rm/clients/4/mifid/reviews
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}

###
@reviewId = {{review.response.body.profile.id}}

### Save all answers (you can also save a few at a time)
PUT {{api}}/api/rm/mifid/reviews/{{reviewId}}/answers
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": {
    "goal": "growth", "horizon": "gt10",
    "income": "50to100", "share": "25to50", "reserve": "3to6m",
    "drawdown": "hold", "maxloss": "l20",
    "exp_equities": "some", "exp_derivatives": "none", "leverage_quiz": "false"
  }
}

### Finish: client accepts (a tiny placeholder signature image)
POST {{api}}/api/rm/mifid/reviews/{{reviewId}}/finish
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "decision": "ACCEPTED",
  "signature": "data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAQAAAC1HAwCAAAAC0lEQVR42mNkYAAAAAYAAjCB0C8AAAAASUVORK5CYII="
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- client self-service
GET {{api}}/api/client/me
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### Clara's own portfolio
GET {{api}}/api/portfolios/1
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### Another client's portfolio -> 404
GET {{api}}/api/portfolios/3
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### Clients can't open the RM book -> 403
GET {{api}}/api/rm/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### ================================================================ Drop B
### Sign in as the administrator (compliance) for the approval requests below
# @name admin
POST {{keycloak}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=wealth-api-tests&username=admin1&password=Admin%232026x

###
@adminToken = {{admin.response.body.access_token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- orders
### Preview: costs and pre-trade checks, nothing saved
POST {{api}}/api/orders/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "portfolioId": 1, "instrumentId": 2, "side": "BUY", "quantity": 20,
  "limitType": "MARKET", "timeInForce": "DAY" }

### Place it (fills at the demo price straight away)
POST {{api}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "portfolioId": 1, "instrumentId": 2, "side": "BUY", "quantity": 20,
  "limitType": "MARKET", "timeInForce": "DAY" }

### Derivative on Pieter's portfolio: big ASML call -> concentration warning -> awaits approval
POST {{api}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "portfolioId": 7, "instrumentId": 18, "side": "BUY", "quantity": 30,
  "limitType": "LIMIT", "limitPrice": 19.00, "timeInForce": "GTC" }

### Discretionary portfolio -> blocked (400)
POST {{api}}/api/orders/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "portfolioId": 3, "instrumentId": 1, "side": "BUY", "quantity": 1,
  "limitType": "MARKET", "timeInForce": "DAY" }

### Blotter
GET {{api}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}

### Compliance: orders awaiting approval
GET {{api}}/api/orders?status=PENDING_APPROVAL
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Approve order 6 (from the demo data)
POST {{api}}/api/admin/orders/6/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "note": "Concentration accepted for this client" }

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- proposals
GET {{api}}/api/proposals
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}

### Proposal 1 (draft) with live checks per line
GET {{api}}/api/proposals/1
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}

### Send it to Clara
POST {{api}}/api/rm/proposals/1/send
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}

### Clara accepts and signs (as the client)
POST {{api}}/api/proposals/1/validate
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "signature": "data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAQAAAC1HAwCAAAAC0lEQVR42mNkYAAAAAYAAjCB0C8AAAAASUVORK5CYII=" }

### RM places its orders
POST {{api}}/api/rm/proposals/1/execute
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}

### Create a new one
POST {{api}}/api/rm/proposals
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "portfolioId": 8, "title": "Build a core equity position",
  "rationale": "Add a diversified world ETF to Elena's first investments.",
  "lines": [ { "instrumentId": 11, "side": "BUY", "quantity": 20, "comment": "All-world ETF" } ] }

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- reports
### Request a statement (returns PENDING; ready a second later)
POST {{api}}/api/portfolios/1/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "STATEMENT" }

###
GET {{api}}/api/portfolios/1/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------- messages
GET {{api}}/api/messages/threads
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}

###
GET {{api}}/api/messages/threads/1
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

###
POST {{api}}/api/messages/threads/1
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "body": "Thanks Ravi, see you Thursday." }

###
GET {{api}}/api/messages/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{rmToken}}
